"entity": {
"name": "4iG Nyrt.",
"description": "4iG Nyrt engages in the development and adaptation of custom software applications. It operates through the following segments: IT and System Integration Services, Telecommunications Services, and Space Industry and Defense Industry Services. The IT and System Integration Services segment includes software and hardware sales, system operation, and support. The Telecommunications Services segment focuses on the operation of telecommunications-related infrastructure. The Space Industry and Defense Industry Services segment relates to space, aerospace, land systems, weapons and ammunition, and cyber and defense digitalization. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Budapest, Hungary.",
